          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[and the p]rice of the '<i>f\u016b\u1e6da</i>' and the [two] '<i>shar\u0101b</i>[<i>iyya</i>s' ... ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">musk, the cup with 10 <i>mithq\u0101l</i>s (by weight) of mu[sk ... ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">two <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s from it, the price of the two <i>mi\u1e25bas</i>es (clothing) [ ... ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and for your excellency, two <i>mi\u1e25bas</i>es. This was sold for the price of [ ... ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">to al-Hind, and thirt[y <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s] come back to you [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">He [w]as with him because his work in bil\u0101[d &hellip; ] had not finished [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s. This (sum) brought 13 <i>bah\u0101r</i>s of pepper in the sm[a]ll [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this [ &hellip; ]. I sold pepper &mdash; some of it for the price of 36 <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s [for a <i>bah\u0101r</i> and some for the price of 37 <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s for a <i>bah\u0101r</i> &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the <i>mi\u1e25bas</i>es and the unfulled cloth were sold as one by [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[A]b\u016b l-Barak\u0101t. As for the fulled (cloth), these were sold for v[arious] prices [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for 24 and one-half <i>zabdiyy</i> (<i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s). The ten <i>bah\u0101r</i>s that were wit[h &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\"><i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i> for a <i>bah\u0101r</i>. I wrote you a copy of the account describing [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">pepper and textiles sold to your excellency. All that [I] sent [ &hellip; silver]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and gold and corals and <i>d\u012bn\u0101r</i>s. All this is described in it [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">a single copy. May God Almighty ordain [its] wellbei[ng &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">drowning at the entrance to the city, as I heard. The creato[r &hellip; ]&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">My lord, may God preserve his life, reported that he (or I?) purchas[ed &hellip; for]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the outcome. His slave informs him that the elder Ma\u1e0dm[\u016bn sent nothing this year neither by]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">sea nor by land. I spoke with him regarding [the dispatch &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[one] <i>bah\u0101r</i>. I could not send you the shipm[ent &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">from [ &hellip; ] He still owes a debt [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">this entire sum. [ &hellip; ] arrived [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">as I wrote. A group of [our associates] arrived this year, [among them Avraham]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">al-\u02bfAkk\u0101w\u012b, the boy of Ibn al-\u02bfAf\u1e63\u012b, and the boy of Sib\u0101\u02bf [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">al-Maghrib\u012b. They only reported good news [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with the government. Many letters arrived for him [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">our associates. Two letters arrived for your excellency [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">they are with this letter of mine. May God Almighty ordai[n his wellbeing &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the error that was between you and the elder Barak\u0101t and if [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the man. I already acknowledged the error and again [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">purchased. I did not pay him anything . He owes me [ &hellip; ]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">I will pay him two dirhams. As for the matter of the betel [ &hellip; two ships arrived]</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">from al-Hind: one large and one smal[l &hellip; ]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
