      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n[ \u2026 ] to the place [ \u2026 ] some of the places. His slave asks him to be patient for its arrival, God willing. Your excellency will not arrive\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n[ \u2026 ] if I were to describe this to you. I will make purchases according to whatever success God Almighty brings you. Go home this year.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDo not delay further for sustenance is ordained. \n</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>",
